WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
It's time to get up, Junior.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
So, you're space cops?

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
No, I'm just being trained.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
All right, do less. Take the ring. And fly.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Just fly.

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
I-I'm sorry. Fly, please.

7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.000
What's that?

8
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.000
You're the backup quarterback.

9
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.000
For now.

10
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.000
It's no accident we're here.

11
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.000
These victims are going to end up being aliens.

12
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Based on what?

13
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.000
I have a feeling.

14
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.000
He has a feeling.

15
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.000
I think this is more than just a feeling.

16
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.000
This is a threat no one's ever seen before.

17
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.000
What do you know about Manhunters?

18
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Where'd you hear that word?

19
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Manhunters are the most dangerous beings to ever exist in the galaxy.

20
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.000
And it could take the form of any species.

21
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.000
So it could be anyone.

22
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.000
The ring's always been mine.

23
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.000
Jordan's just keeping it warm.

24
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Do you know how?

25
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:16.000
[Music]

26
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.000
In brightest day,

27
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.000
in blackest night,

28
00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:26.000
no evil shall escape my sight.

29
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Let those who worship evil's might

30
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.000
beware my power:

31
00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:38.000
Green Lantern's light!

32
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:47.000
How about a beer?
